text": "Valeu! Qualquer coisa, chama!", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 4, "stopped": true}, {"start": 24.088, "end": 24.448, "natural_end": 24.568, "dur": 0.36, "text": "Tchau!", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 1, "stopped": true}, {"start": 28.451, "end": 29.044, "natural_end": 30.691, "dur": 0.593, "text": "Ah, isso é bem comum, muita gente sente isso.", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 9, "stopped": true}, {"start": 32.88, "end": 33.843, "natural_end": 35.6, "dur": 0.964, "text": "Entendo. Muita coisa acontece fora do que a gente imagina.", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 10, "stopped": true}, {"start": 40.124, "end": 40.44, "natural_end": 42.684, "dur": 0.315, "text": "Isso é super normal. Às vezes a gente se isola mesmo.", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 11, "stopped": true}, {"start": 44.463, "end": 46.626, "natural_end": 47.343, "dur": 2.163, "text": "Faz sentido. É um processo de mudança de visão.", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 9, "stopped": true}, {"start": 52.132, "end": 53.119, "natural_end": 53.652, "dur": 0.987, "text": "Depende muito do lugar, né?", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 5, "stopped": true}, {"start": 59.924, "end": 60.8, "natural_end": 61.364, "dur": 0.876, "text": "É um debate constante, viu?", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 5, "stopped": true}, {"start": 64.777, "end": 67.017, "natural_end": 67.017, "dur": 2.24, "text": "Isso sim, é um fator social bem marcado.", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 8, "stopped": true}, {"start": 68.645, "end": 70.134, "natural_end": 71.605, "dur": 1.488, "text": "É a diferença entre o que é normal e o que é diferente .", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 14, "stopped": true}, {"start": 75.455, "end": 75.708, "natural_end": 77.215, "d